{"3993470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Starblade", "steam_appid": 3993470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993470/extras/1de2445ed2742d0a928e5247eac174c6.avif?t=1773037151\" width=1560 height=219 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993470/extras/30e5a6bffe5588019bbc441e30a93148.avif?t=1773037151\" width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Fathom Labratories and thank you for your interest in our &quot;Starblade&quot; program!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If selected to be a test subject, you can expect an exclusive inside look at our cutting-edge testing facilities in an undisclosed location and - <i>if you're lucky</i> - even get your hands on some of our exciting new products still in development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your stay, you will be tasked with completing three unique sets of testing exercises with increasing levels of complexity. If you perform well you may even be selected to participate in our &quot;advanced&quot; testing and be granted clearance to explore the public areas of our research department!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993470/extras/f687b623d87e3e5ee18e32af71de796a.avif?t=1773037151\" width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WARNING: Tresspassing in areas you are not cleared for may result in fines, personal injury, or death. Fathom Laboratories is not liable for any physical or emotional damageyou may or may not suffer while on its premises. <br><br>Happy Testing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993470/extras/e3bb311f19aa963bf3ece094806f96c3.avif?t=1773037151\" width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993470/extras/1de2445ed2742d0a928e5247eac174c6.avif?t=1773037151\" width=1560 height=219 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993470/extras/30e5a6bffe5588019bbc441e30a93148.avif?t=1773037151\" width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Fathom Labratories and thank you for your interest in our &quot;Starblade&quot; program!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If selected to be a test subject, you can expect an exclusive inside look at our cutting-edge testing facilities in an undisclosed location and - <i>if you're lucky</i> - even get your hands on some of our exciting new products still in development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your stay, you will be tasked with completing three unique sets of testing exercises with increasing levels of complexity. If you perform well you may even be selected to participate in our &quot;advanced&quot; testing and be granted clearance to explore the public areas of our research department!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993470/extras/f687b623d87e3e5ee18e32af71de796a.avif?t=1773037151\" width=1560 height=219 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap